{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51811","headline":"司空山闻子规 · 陆蟾","name":"司空山闻子规","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後夜入清明，游人何处听？\n花残斑竹庙，雨歇岘山亭。\n树罅月欲落，窗间酒正醒。\n衆鸟方在梦，谁念尔劳形？\n（《诗话总龟》十一引《雅言系述》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}